{"items":[{"id":"1651614580697837568","title":"3年前开始写知乎，一个月两篇万赞，以为…","content":"<p>3年前开始写知乎，一个月两篇万赞，以为是起点，结果是巅峰。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3年前开始写公号，第一篇阅读几百，3年后第一篇10w+。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;还挺感概的。</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-9f1f30e33c8e125cf7d418093e629cca_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1030\">","excerpt":"3年前开始写知乎，一个月两篇万赞，以为…","voteupCount":104,"commentCount":15,"created":1686555725,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1651614580697837568"},{"id":"1651275729055731712","title":"6块钱一小时","content":"<p>6块钱一小时</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c5bc0ba65fd0e5afa17922579606c9b6_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"990\" height=\"842\">","excerpt":"6块钱一小时","voteupCount":91,"commentCount":37,"created":1686474813,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1651275729055731712"},{"id":"1650602905978855424","title":"我是服气的","content":"<p>我是服气的</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-f8ff47a12d088823eb15bceaebbcc32d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"906\">","excerpt":"我是服气的","voteupCount":168,"commentCount":19,"created":1686314399,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1650602905978855424"},{"id":"1650201908647366656","title":"现在发现该说不说，社会的治理能力还是有…","content":"<p>现在发现该说不说，社会的治理能力还是有提升的。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;以前消灭城中村：清理低端人口&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;现在消灭城中村：方便人才安居&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;春秋笔法，不外如此。</p>","excerpt":"现在发现该说不说，社会的治理能力还是有…","voteupCount":118,"commentCount":4,"created":1686218794,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1650201908647366656"},{"id":"1649751339277135872","title":"这个对比挺好的","content":"<p>这个对比挺好的。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;你要像柯南，商人的孩子还是商人，资本家的孩子还是资本家，那啥的孩子还是那啥，就太不符合核心价值观了。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d4b5deab6f3f3f588a4103366c185808_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"572\" height=\"295\">","excerpt":"这个对比挺好的","voteupCount":204,"commentCount":17,"created":1686111370,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1649751339277135872"},{"id":"1649385914244878336","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-5ec1f1a65705105a6d18ef5e545f9389_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":174,"commentCount":16,"created":1686024246,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1649385914244878336"},{"id":"1648112205093556224","title":"我身边有小朋友工作一年就换上了宝马五系…","content":"<p>我身边有小朋友工作一年就换上了宝马五系，我问他做的啥工作这么能赚。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;他说：做的父母思想工作。</p>","excerpt":"我身边有小朋友工作一年就换上了宝马五系…","voteupCount":153,"commentCount":4,"created":1685720570,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1648112205093556224"},{"id":"1646946418693705728","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-f07265138f38f8b04cd65a340caef40f_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"1502\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-cec2edde2bc79ed775ceea90d98b509c_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"1438\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-e2f8528469995649b72dcf9c09fce8bb_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"1405\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-047fb3d759f63e0ce26e03dd959b9b59_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"1386\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-840a106b850da4533e2cdb8d4cfe1f7a_xl.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1170\" height=\"1411\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":133,"commentCount":11,"created":1685442625,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1646946418693705728"},{"id":"1646465719930957825","title":"其实仔细想想，互联网企业为什么过去这么…","content":"<p>其实仔细想想，互联网企业为什么过去这么受重视呢？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;互联网企业给年薪30w，打工人上车买了500w房子，还把房价给推上去了，最后形势不好再把这个人给裁了，你说说这是不是强逻辑闭环。</p>","excerpt":"其实仔细想想，互联网企业为什么过去这么…","voteupCount":106,"commentCount":7,"created":1685328092,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1646465719930957825"},{"id":"1643940849817042944","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-754e3c07be4c39420b6040dd45116dc6_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"726\" height=\"726\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":82,"commentCount":8,"created":1684726041,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1643940849817042944"}]}